 "what_this_is": "GAP-RITUAL-006's closure test asks for material-culture counts reported split by context. This is that split, over every Crop, Metal and Animal mention of the mention layer, joined to the four-valued ritual_context proposed here.",
 "the_split_is_not_ritual_versus_everyday": "NO_RITUAL_CITATION_FOUND is a measured absence against eighteen acquired works, not a finding that a mention is domestic. No mantra in this artifact is marked NON_RITUAL. A reader who collapses the four values into two will invent the very distinction the evidence cannot support.",
