  "RITE_NAMED_IN_THIS_MANTRA": "The mantra itself names a rite. A different claim from being employed in one.",
  "UNRESOLVED_SHARED_OPENING": "The mantra's opening letters are shared with at least one other mantra, so a quotation of that opening cannot be attributed to it. The rivals are named. This is NOT evidence of absence.",
